Eclipse Hopson Sentinel — distribution status

This repository combines original Eclipse Hopson work with components imported
from third-party projects.

The TypeScript CLI was adapted from Gitlawb/openclaude. That upstream project
states that its base layer derives from Anthropic's proprietary Claude Code
software and that only contributor modifications are offered under MIT where
legally permissible. The original import commit was not recorded here, so the
applicable boundary cannot currently be reconstructed with confidence.

Original Eclipse Hopson modifications are offered under the MIT License only
to the extent that the author has the right to license them. This statement
does not grant rights to third-party code.

The repository as a whole is not offered for public redistribution, package
publication, sublicensing, or sale until exact upstream revisions and license
obligations are documented and reviewed.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for component provenance.
